hanics  will make village as capcom says the  most immersive  resident evil to date  [Applause]  [Music]  father  sony's santa monica studio is returning  with a follow-up to  2018's god of war the first and so far  only teaser trailer for the unnamed god  of war sequel  reveals nothing more than the game's  logo but the confirmation of getting a  sequel in 2021  has been enough to get fans excited and  get them  analyzing given how god of war ends many  fans assume this sequel will involve  ragnarok in some capacity  reddit users have also tried to decipher  a code finding that it may point towards  freya having a big role in the sequel  but that hasn't been confirmed yet  all of our unanswered questions and  unentered realms will have to be  revisited next year  you must prepare yourself  [Music]  [Music]  halo infinite was originally set for  2020 but was delayed to 2021 to ensure  the quality of the game  meets the franchise's standards when the  game is finally in our hands expect a  single player campaign  with a renewed focus on master chief in  its story and of course  a multiplayer mode we've seen a few  tweaks to gameplay so far  including a grappling hook and a  reintroduction of sprinting and sliding  i'm already eager to play but i'm also  willing to wait however long it's  necessary to do chief justice  2021 is already looking stacked so which  games are you looking forward to the  most  we also have a few videos on our channel  for 2021 games  specifically for either the ps5 or the  xbox series x  so feel free to check those out if you  want to see what else is on the way  thanks for watching like subscribe and  we'll see you next time  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

